Z||000000||MrPBody||04-20-2001||11:47 AM||||Obviously, I'm not trying to insult any forum members, but -- since we have members from all over -- what's your opinion?<P>I think it's either Ohio or Alabama.  (Sorry -- nothing personal, really!)<P>There may be a case for Georgia having the worst, but I think mostly they're not <I>bad</I>, just crazy!<BR>||||reg||1
