Z||000016||Shaft||04-21-2001||02:30 AM||||RIGHT ON CHADMAN! I think Ohio is the worst by far...except for me of course. When I drive through MI I can always tell when I'm comming up behind an Ohio driver. They ride in the left lane no matter what spped they're going and they'll never move over to let traffic by. They don't know how to merge or yield. And my favorite is when someone sits at a traffic light the whole time it's green and when it's yellow they zip through leaving everyone stuck at the light. The best part is all the other OH drivers are so stupid they don't blow their horn at people like that. They'll sit there and wait!!!||||reg||1
